The '''Candy Artifact''' is an {{Epic}} [[Accessory]] that can be bought from the [[Fear Mongerer]]. It is the upgraded form of the [[Candy Ring]]. It increases the chance of getting {{LI|Green Candy}} and {{LI|Purple Candy}} from mobs during the [[Spooky Festival]] by {{green|15%}}.

== Obtaining ==
=== Shop Purchase ===
It can be purchased from the [[Fear Mongerer]] during the [[Spooky Festival]].
